WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.950
Claimant: Hi, I swerved to avoid a deer and hit a guardrail. I didn’t hit the deer, but the front fender is dented.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:27.350
Adjuster: Decision: excluded. The claimant reports hitting a guardrail without contacting the deer, so the loss is a collision rather than direct animal contact classified as other-than-collision. The declarations state that no collision coverage was purchased. Next action: Deny coverage for this loss because collision coverage was not purchased.
